<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">the continued right of the Sponsor to hold Class&nbsp;A Common Stock and the shares of Class&nbsp;A Common Stock
to be issued to the Sponsor upon exercise of its Company Private Warrants following the Business Combination, subject to certain <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">lock-up</FONT> periods; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
