<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The obligations of SMX, Parent and Merger Sub to consummate the Business Combination are subject to the satisfaction or waiver (where
permissible) of additional conditions, including: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
