will own approximately 54.27% of the issued and outstanding Parent Shares. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following table illustrates the ownership levels in Parent
