<TD WIDTH="5%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="3%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">&#149;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">We may amend the terms of the Company Public Warrants in a manner that may be adverse to holders with the
approval by the holders of at least 50% of the then-outstanding Company Public Warrants. As a result, the exercise price of a holder&#146;s Company Public Warrants could be increased, the exercise period could be shortened and the number of shares
of the Company&#146;s Common Stock purchasable upon exercise of a Company Public Warrant could be decreased, all without the approval of that warrant holder. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
