<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">If the Post-Combination Company fails to maintain an effective system of disclosure controls and internal
controls over financial reporting, its ability to produce timely and accurate financial statements or comply with applicable regulations could be impaired. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
