on a standalone basis pre-transaction and on a pro forma basis giving effect to the transaction contemplated by the SID and BCA; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
