<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The above covenants are incorporated by reference into the BCA. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Conduct of Business by SMX pending the Merger </I></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Under the SID, SMX will take all reasonable steps to implement the Scheme in accordance with the SID as soon as reasonably practicable,
including: (i)&nbsp;announcing the SMX directors&#146; recommendation to vote in favor of the Scheme and Capital Reduction, (ii)&nbsp;preparing the Scheme Booklet, (iii)&nbsp;appointing an independent expert and investigating accountant,
(iv)&nbsp;coordinating with ASIC, the Court and Lionheart, (v)&nbsp;sending the Scheme Booklet to SMX shareholders, (vi)&nbsp;convening certain meetings, (vii)&nbsp;implementing the Capital Reduction and Option Scheme and (viii)&nbsp;issuing one SMX
share to Parent. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="5%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="3%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">&#149;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Under the SID, from the date of signing of the SID to the Implementation Date (as defined in the SID), (x) SMX
will, and will cause its subsidiaries to use all reasonable endeavors to conduct its business in all material respects in the ordinary course consistent with business plans and budgets disclosed to Lionheart and in substantially the same manner as
previously conducted, and (y)&nbsp;except with the prior written approval of Lionheart (not to be unreasonably withheld or delayed), SMX will use reasonable best efforts to ensure that SMX (and its subsidiaries):maintains the condition of its
business and material assets in all material respects; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
