<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">The adjustment reflects acceleration of vesting of unvested options as a result of becoming fully vested upon
Transactions for which the future remaining expenses are recognized immediately in accordance with IFRS 2 </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
