<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Represents the difference between the settlement payment of the loan bonus to related parties and the carrying
amount of the liability for the loan bonus as of 31 December, 2021. Refer also to Note 10 of SMX financial statements for 2021. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
