<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>In this section &#147;we,&#148; &#147;us,&#148; &#147;our&#148; or the &#147;Company&#148; refer to the Company prior to the Business Combination and
&#147;Board&#148; refers to the Board of Directors of the Company prior to the Business Combination. </I></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Directors and Executive Officers </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company&#146;s current directors and executive officers are as follows: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
