<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">&#147;30-day</FONT> redemption period&#148;) to each warrant holder; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
