<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">In March 2020, the Company raised capital, in consideration of an aggregate of $4,004 in net proceeds. The
Company issued 18,879,647 shares and 6,317,721 warrants. The terms of the warrants specify that each warrant has an exercise price of AU$0.6, expires in March 2023. The financial advisors received 3,250,000 warrants with exercise price of AU$0.6,
expires in May 2023. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>C. Options granted to employees and service providers: </B></P>
