(AU$2&nbsp;million), for the period until October 31, 2022. Under the Agreement, SMX retains full control of the subscription process, with the discretion as to whether to request share placements, the timing of the share placements and the maximum
number of shares to be requested to be issued under each placement; the purchase price per Share is of 91.5% of the of the volume weighted average price of Shares during the relevant Valuation Period with a floor price of AU$0.17.
