outbreaks thereof). </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">COVID-19</FONT> Measures </B>means any quarantine, &#147;shelter in place&#148;,
