<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Independent Expert </B>means the independent expert approved by Lionheart and appointed by SMX under clause 6.2(c). </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Independent Expert&#146;s Report </B>means the report from the Independent Expert for inclusion in the Scheme Booklet, including any update
or supplementary report, stating whether in the Independent Expert&#146;s opinion: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
