</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">except, in the case of each of the foregoing clauses (a), (b), (c), (d) and (e), if the effects of such events, matters
or circumstances are disproportionately adverse to the Lionheart Group as compared to the effects on other companies in the industry in which the Lionheart Group operates, and then solely to the extent of such disproportionate effect. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Lionheart Merger</B> has the meaning ascribed to &#147;Merger&#148; in the BCA. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Lionheart Prescribed Event </B>means, except to the extent contemplated by this document, the BCA, the Schemes, or any other Transaction
