shares, other than a conversion of Lionheart B Shares to Lionheart A Shares pursuant to the terms of Lionheart&#146;s Certificate of Incorporation; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
