wholly owned Subsidiary of Lionheart) resolves to reduce its share capital in any way or resolves to reclassify, combine or split directly or indirectly any of its shares, other than in connection with the exercise of Redemption Rights that are
required pursuant to the terms of Lionheart&#146;s Certificate of Incorporation; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">B1-9 </P>

