at Sponsor&#146;s election in accordance the terms thereof, or (ii)&nbsp;a PIPE Investment; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
