<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Material Contract </B>means any agreement entered into by a member of the SMX Group (or a joint venture entity to which the SMX Group is a
shareholder) (excluding any SMX Employee Plan): </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
