Excluded SMX Optionholder. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Option Scheme Meeting</B> means the meeting of SMX Optionholders ordered by the Court to be convened under
