<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Option Scheme Record Date</B> means 7.00pm on the 2nd Business Day following the Effective Date or any other date as agreed by SMX, Parent
