<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Post-Signing Returns</B> has the meaning given to that term in clause 4.9. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Record Date </B>means 7.00 pm on the date which is 2 Business Days after the Effective Date, or such other Business Day agreed by Lionheart,
