<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Regulator&#146;s Draft </B>means the draft of the Scheme Booklet in a form acceptable to both parties which is provided to ASIC for approval
pursuant to section 411(2) of the Corporations Act. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Regulatory Approval </B>means: </P>
