<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">After the date of this document and prior to the Implementation Date, Lionheart shall deliver, or cause to be
delivered, to Parent a duly executed certificate and notice in compliance with Treasury Regulations Sections <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">1.897-2(h)</FONT> and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">1.1445-2(c)(3),</FONT> certifying that Lionheart is
not, and has not been at any time during the five year period ending on the Implementation Date, a &#147;United States real property holding corporation&#148; within the meaning of Section&nbsp;897(c)(2) of the Code, together with any notifications
to the U.S. Internal Revenue Service related thereto within the timeframe provided in Treasury Regulations <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Section&nbsp;1.897-2(h)(2)(v).</FONT> </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
