reporting obligations of Treasury Regulations <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Section&nbsp;1.367(a)-3(c)(6).</FONT> </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
