<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Any Transfer Taxes incurred in connection with the Transactions shall be paid by Parent. Parent, Surviving
Lionheart, and SMX shall cooperate in filing, when required by applicable Law, all necessary documentation and Tax Returns with respect to such Transfer Taxes. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
