<TD WIDTH="11%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">
consideration of the cancellation of each SMX Share issued to each Option Scheme Participant as an Option Exercise Share under the Option Scheme, on the Implementation Date, Parent will provide
or procure that the Cancellation Consideration in respect of each such SMX Share issued to the Option Scheme Participant under the Option Scheme, in accordance with the Option Scheme. </TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="5%">&nbsp;</TD>
