with any such request would not, in the reasonable opinion of SMX (acting in good faith), result in undue disruption to the SMX Group&#146;s business and provided that SMX is not required to facilitate physical access where SMX is restricted from
doing so by any <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">COVID-19</FONT> Measures; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
