<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">SMX will not be required to provide any access or take any action contemplated by this clause 9.7 to the extent
