<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">after receiving written advice from its external legal advisors, that failing to respond to the SMX Competing
Transaction would be reasonably likely to constitute a breach of any member of the SMX Board&#146;s fiduciary or statutory obligations, </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">provided that if SMX makes available to any such offeror any <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-public</FONT> information relating to any
member of the SMX Group or their businesses or operations, SMX may only do so pursuant to a confidentiality agreement with terms no less favourable in the aggregate to SMX than those contained in the Confidentiality Agreement. </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="5%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><B>10.6</B></TD>
