<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">During the Exclusivity Period, SMX and Lionheart must promptly (and in any event within 24&nbsp;hours) inform
the other party if it or, to its knowledge, any of its Representatives, or in the case of SMX, Parent or any of its Representatives: </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
