<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Clause 11.5(c) does not limit the liability of SMX under or in connection with this deed in respect of any
