<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Subject to clauses 12.4(a), Lionheart must pay the SMX Break Fee to SMX without withholding or set off if: </P>
