<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">withdraws, changes, qualifies, adversely revises or adversely qualifies their support of the Lionheart
Proposals or their recommendation that Lionheart Shareholders vote in favour of the Lionheart Proposals or fails to recommend that Lionheart Shareholders vote in favour of the Lionheart Proposals in the manner described in clause 7.2;
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
