meaning of Section&nbsp;7874(a)(2)(B) of the Code or (ii)&nbsp;treated as a U.S. corporation under Section&nbsp;7874(b) of the Code; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
